# Ignore everything by default
*

# Track config and skills
!.gitignore
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!settings.json
!statusline-command.sh
# skills/ mixes real dirs (committed) with machine-local symlinks into
# ~/.agents/skills — those break on any other clone, so ignore everything under
# skills/ by default and whitelist only the real skill dirs we want tracked.
!skills/
!skills/fleet-overview/
!skills/fleet-overview/**
!commands/
!commands/**
!hooks/
!hooks/**
!agents/
!agents/**
# beads janitor: manual sweep script
!bin/
!bin/beads-janitor.sh
# beads-status TUI: source only — the binary is rebuilt locally
# (cd tools/beads-status && go build -o ~/.claude/bin/beads-status .)
!tools/
!tools/beads-status/
!tools/beads-status/README.md
!tools/beads-status/go.mod
!tools/beads-status/go.sum
!tools/beads-status/main.go
